(i) - 'a');\n            }\n            \n            int nextLetter = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < a; i++) {\n                while (usedInSuffix.contains(nextLetter)) {\n                    nextLetter++;\n                }\n                sb.append((char) ('a' + nextLetter));\n                usedInSuffix.add(nextLetter);\n                nextLetter++;\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Count distinct letters in range [l, r]\n        Set<Integer> distinctLetters = new HashSet<>();\n        for (int i = l - 1; i < r; i++) {\n            distinctLetters.add(sb.charAt(i) - 'a');\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(distinctLetters.size());\n    }\n}\n</repaired_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.576278118089249e-07, -3.802703940891661e-05, -3.099436753473128e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.0001726001501083374, -1.7881233361549675e-05, -7.867782187531702e-06, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -8.880697714630514e-05, -7.867782187531702e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.6954195820726454e-05, -8.4638240878121e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -7.199982064776123e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -8.22540732769994e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.0004314445541240275, -4.768370445162873e-07, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.4543427823809907e-05, -9.536738616588991e-07, -6.556489552167477e-06, -9.417489309271332e-06, -6.318072337307967e-06, -0.00015472168161068112, -1.3947389561508317e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.145764938177308e-06, -2.062299427052494e-05, -2.50339189733495e-06, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.288792165927589e-05, -6.437280717364047e-06, -3.731181277544238e-05, -5.364403477869928e-06, -0.0009133219718933105, -4.875540980719961e-05, -7.986990567587782e-06, -1.9073468138230965e-06, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -6.6756979322235566e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.0251946150674485e-05, -